# Gloom's "Activated abilities of white enchantments cost {3} more to activate" taxes a mana ability too: a mana ability is
# activated as any other activated ability is (CR 605.3, 602.2b), so the increase is part of its total cost (CR 601.2f).
# Enchanted Evening makes Giada, Font of Hope a white enchantment, and her "{T}: Add {W}" then costs {3}: with an empty pool
# and nothing else to tap it is not offered (refused while the mana is short), and with {U}{U}{U} from a Black Lotus it is
# paid with all three, leaving only her {W}, which may be spent only on an Angel spell. Gloom is cast last, so it taxes
# neither Enchanted Evening nor Giada.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Enchanted Evening
Giada, Font of Hope
Gloom
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

